# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A ramp turns a hue-cycling pattern into ONE palette: the interference field
# keyed on its own brightness into deep-water blues. A sparse second pattern
# ADDED on top — raindrop rings, ramped to sea-foam — ripples through it.
S - Tidepool
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Deep water
I @pat/interference
C sliderStyle 65536
C sliderOrbitS 3932160
R 100 0:000510 100:003a66 200:0f8fa8 255:9ff7ff
L pat 0 0 0 0 add 70 none fill 1
N Rings
I @pat/raindrops-2d
C sliderMode 65536
R 100 0:000000 255:d8fffa
